{"seq":3,"slug":"cell-division","title":"高一生物 — 细胞分裂","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/cell-biology-adv/cell-division","wordCount":2269,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一生物-细胞分裂\">高一生物 — 细胞分裂</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>一个受精卵如何发育成拥有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>37</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">37</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37</span></span></span></span></span> 万亿个细胞的人体？答案是细胞分裂。细胞分裂是生物体生长、发育和繁殖的基础。真核细胞的分裂方式主要有三种：有丝分裂、无丝分裂和减数分裂。其中有丝分裂是最常见的方式，它通过精确的染色体复制和均等分配，确保子细胞获得与母细胞完全相同的遗传信息。减数分裂则是形成生殖细胞的特殊方式，染色体数目减半，为有性生殖中遗传多样性的产生提供了细胞学基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-细胞周期\">一、细胞周期</h3><p><strong>定义</strong>：连续分裂的细胞从一次分裂完成到下一次分裂完成所经历的全过程，称为一个细胞周期。</p>\n<p>细胞周期分为两个阶段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>时长占比</th>\n<th>主要事件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分裂间期（G1 + S + G2）</td>\n<td>约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>DNA 复制、蛋白质合成、细胞生长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分裂期（M期）</td>\n<td>约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>染色体分离、细胞一分为二</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>间期各阶段</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>G1期</strong>（DNA合成前期）：细胞生长，合成 RNA 和蛋白质，为 DNA 复制做准备</li>\n<li><strong>S期</strong>（DNA合成期）：DNA 复制，每条染色体变成由两条姐妹染色单体通过着丝点相连的结构</li>\n<li><strong>G2期</strong>（DNA合成后期）：继续合成蛋白质（如纺锤丝蛋白），为分裂做最后准备</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"二-有丝分裂\">二、有丝分裂</h3><p>有丝分裂的分裂期分为前期、中期、后期和末期四个阶段（实际上是连续过程）：</p>\n<p><strong>前期</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>染色质螺旋化缩短变粗，形成可见的染色体（每条染色体由两条姐妹染色单体组成）</li>\n<li>核仁逐渐消失，核膜解体</li>\n<li>中心体（动物细胞）发出纺锤丝，形成纺锤体</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>中期</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有染色体的着丝点排列在细胞中央的赤道板上</li>\n<li>染色体形态最清晰、最典型——是观察和计数染色体的最佳时期</li>\n<li>纺锤丝连接在着丝点上</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>后期</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>着丝点一分为二，姐妹染色单体分开，成为两条独立的染色体</li>\n<li>纺锤丝牵引染色体向细胞两极移动</li>\n<li>此时细胞中的染色体数目暂时加倍</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>末期</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>染色体到达两极后解螺旋，恢复为染色质状态</li>\n<li>核膜重新形成，核仁重新出现</li>\n<li>纺锤体消失</li>\n<li>动物细胞：细胞膜从中部向内凹陷，将细胞缢裂为二</li>\n<li>植物细胞：在赤道板位置形成细胞板，由内向外扩展形成新的细胞壁</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>有丝分裂中 DNA 和染色体数目的变化</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>DNA数</th>\n<th>染色体数</th>\n<th>染色单体数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>G1期</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S期（完成后）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前期-中期</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后期</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子细胞</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（以二倍体生物为例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 表示一个染色体组中的染色体数）</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-有丝分裂的意义\">三、有丝分裂的意义</h3><p>有丝分裂最重要的意义在于：<strong>通过染色体的精确复制和均等分配，保证了子细胞与母细胞具有相同的遗传信息</strong>。</p>\n<p>这对于多细胞生物的生长和发育至关重要——人体的皮肤细胞、血细胞、肠壁细胞都在不断进行有丝分裂来更新替换衰老死亡的细胞。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-减数分裂\">四、减数分裂</h3><p><strong>定义</strong>：进行有性生殖的生物在产生成熟生殖细胞（配子）时进行的一种特殊的细胞分裂方式。</p>\n<p><strong>特点</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>染色体只复制一次，但细胞连续分裂两次</li>\n<li>结果是子细胞的染色体数目减半（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n \\to n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>减数分裂 I（减数第一次分裂）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>关键事件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前期 I</td>\n<td><strong>同源染色体联会</strong>，形成四分体；可能发生<strong>交叉互换</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中期 I</td>\n<td>同源染色体对排列在赤道板两侧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后期 I</td>\n<td><strong>同源染色体分离</strong>，非同源染色体自由组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末期 I</td>\n<td>形成两个子细胞，每个细胞的染色体数目为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（但每条仍有姐妹染色单体）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>减数分裂 II（减数第二次分裂）</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>关键事件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前期 II</td>\n<td>类似有丝分裂前期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中期 II</td>\n<td>着丝点排列在赤道板上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后期 II</td>\n<td>着丝点分裂，姐妹染色单体分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末期 II</td>\n<td>形成四个子细胞，每个含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 条染色体</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>重要概念</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>同源染色体</strong>：形态、大小一般相同，一条来自父方、一条来自母方的一对染色体</li>\n<li><strong>联会</strong>：减数分裂前期 I 中，同源染色体两两配对的过程</li>\n<li><strong>四分体</strong>：联会后的一对同源染色体，包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 条染色单体</li>\n<li><strong>交叉互换</strong>：四分体中，非姐妹染色单体之间交换片段</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"五-有丝分裂与减数分裂的比较\">五、有丝分裂与减数分裂的比较</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>比较项</th>\n<th>有丝分裂</th>\n<th>减数分裂</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分裂次数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNA 复制</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子细胞数目</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 个</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子细胞染色体数</td>\n<td>与母细胞相同（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>母细胞的一半（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同源染色体联会</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有（减 I 前期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同源染色体分离</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有（减 I 后期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子细胞遗传信息</td>\n<td>与母细胞相同</td>\n<td>彼此不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发生部位</td>\n<td>体细胞</td>\n<td>生殖器官（产生配子）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"六-减数分裂与遗传多样性\">六、减数分裂与遗传多样性</h3><p>减数分裂通过两种机制产生遗传多样性：</p>\n<p><strong>（一）非同源染色体的自由组合</strong></p>\n<p>在减 I 后期，非同源染色体随机分向两极。如果生物有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 对同源染色体，则可能产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种不同的配子。人有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">23</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23</span></span></span></span></span> 对同源染色体，仅通过自由组合就能产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>23</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8388608</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{23} = 8388608</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">23</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8388608</span></span></span></span></span> 种（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>840</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">840</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">840</span></span></span></span></span> 万种）不同的精子或卵细胞。</p>\n<p><strong>（二）交叉互换</strong></p>\n<p>四分体中非姐妹染色单体交换片段后，产生了新的基因组合。这使得遗传多样性进一步增加。</p>\n<h3 id=\"七-观察细胞分裂的实验\">七、观察细胞分裂的实验</h3><p><strong>观察植物根尖细胞有丝分裂</strong>：</p>\n<p>实验步骤：取材 → 解离 → 漂洗 → 染色 → 制片 → 观察</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>试剂/方法</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解离</td>\n<td>盐酸-酒精混合液（卡诺固定液）</td>\n<td>使细胞分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漂洗</td>\n<td>清水</td>\n<td>洗去解离液，防止影响染色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>染色</td>\n<td>龙胆紫或醋酸洋红</td>\n<td>将染色体染成深色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压片</td>\n<td>拇指轻压盖玻片</td>\n<td>使细胞分散成单层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>观察到的大多数细胞处于间期（因为间期时间最长），处于分裂期各阶段的细胞较少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某生物体细胞有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 条染色体。画出有丝分裂后期和减数第一次分裂后期的细胞示意图，分别标注染色体数目。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一个含有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 条染色体的细胞进行有丝分裂，分裂后期细胞中有多少条染色体？多少条染色单体？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么减数分裂能产生遗传信息不同的配子，而有丝分裂产生的子细胞遗传信息相同？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>人的体细胞有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>46</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">46</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">46</span></span></span></span></span> 条染色体（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">23</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23</span></span></span></span></span> 对），精子和卵细胞各有多少条？受精卵有多少条？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考：如果减数分裂时同源染色体没有正确分离（非整倍体），会产生什么后果？试举一个实例。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>细胞周期的调控是当代细胞生物学的核心课题。2001年诺贝尔生理学或医学奖授予了哈特韦尔、亨特和纳斯，以表彰他们发现了控制细胞周期的关键蛋白——细胞周期蛋白（Cyclin）和周期蛋白依赖激酶（CDK）。细胞在进入 S 期（DNA复制）和 M 期（分裂）之前，分别有 G1/S 和 G2/M 两个检查点，确保 DNA 没有损伤、复制完整后才允许继续。如果这些调控机制出了问题，细胞就会不受控制地分裂，这正是癌症发生的核心机制之一。理解细胞周期调控已成为开发新型抗癌药物的重要方向——多种靶向 CDK 的药物已进入临床使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>细胞周期包括间期（DNA复制和细胞生长）和分裂期。有丝分裂经过前期、中期、后期和末期，通过染色体的精确复制和均等分配，确保子细胞与母细胞遗传信息一致。减数分裂是产生配子的特殊分裂方式，染色体只复制一次但分裂两次，子细胞染色体数目减半。减 I 的关键事件是同源染色体联会、交叉互换和同源染色体分离；减 II 类似有丝分裂。非同源染色体的自由组合和交叉互换是产生遗传多样性的两大来源。掌握细胞分裂是理解遗传学的重要基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一生物 — 细胞分裂","id":"高一生物-细胞分裂"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、细胞周期","id":"一-细胞周期"},{"level":3,"text":"二、有丝分裂","id":"二-有丝分裂"},{"level":3,"text":"三、有丝分裂的意义","id":"三-有丝分裂的意义"},{"level":3,"text":"四、减数分裂","id":"四-减数分裂"},{"level":3,"text":"五、有丝分裂与减数分裂的比较","id":"五-有丝分裂与减数分裂的比较"},{"level":3,"text":"六、减数分裂与遗传多样性","id":"六-减数分裂与遗传多样性"},{"level":3,"text":"七、观察细胞分裂的实验","id":"七-观察细胞分裂的实验"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一生物 — 细胞代谢","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/cell-biology-adv/cell-metabolism"},"next":{"title":"高一生物 — 孟德尔定律","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/biology/genetics/mendel-laws"}}